{"_v":1,"id":"motown-the-musical-2016","bd":{"positive":8,"mixed":5,"negative":2},"rv":[{"cn":"Jennifer Farrar","o":"Associated Press","s":78,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://www.washingtonpost.com/entertainment/music/review-catchy-return-of-motown-the-musical-on-broadway/2016/07/21/1b6a4cdc-4fa1-11e6-bf27-405106836f96_story.html","q":"Like the legendary music catalog from Motown, the revival that re-opened Thursday night at the Nederlander Theatre is alternately catchy and soulful, and overstuffed with memorable melodies."},{"cn":"Frank Scheck","o":"The Hollywood Reporter","s":71,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"http://www.hollywoodreporter.com/review/motown-musical-theater-review-912451","d":"2016-07-21","q":"If you plan to see Motown: The Musical because you're a fan of R&B icons like Marvin Gaye, Diana Ross and Stevie Wonder, then you won't be disappointed."},{"cn":"Michael Billington","o":"The Guardian","s":63,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://www.theguardian.com/stage/2016/mar/08/motown-the-musical-review-berry-gordy-shaftesbury-theatre","d":"2016-03-08","q":"Even with this relentless exposure, Gordy himself remains something of a mystery."},{"cn":"Charles Isherwood","o":"The New York Times","s":63,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://www.nytimes.com/2016/07/22/theater/review-motown-the-musical-offers-easy-nostalgia-and-a-jolt-of-racial-relevance.html","q":"But who’s coming to see “Motown” for anything other than the fabulous songbook?"},{"cn":"Mark Shenton","o":"The Stage","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.thestage.co.uk/reviews/43652","q":"One is ultimately powerless to resist the onslaught of great songs."},{"cn":"Zachary Stewart","o":"TheaterMania","s":67,"b":"Mixed","t":2,"u":"http://www.theatermania.com/broadway/reviews/motown-the-musical_77848.html","d":"2016-07-21","q":"If you can ignore the cringe-inducing book scenes, you will probably have a good time."},{"cn":"Jonathan Mandell","o":"New York Theater","s":61,"b":"Mixed","t":2,"u":"https://newyorktheater.me/2016/07/21/motown-the-musical-review-back-on-broadway/","q":"This time around, I didn’t fall."},{"cn":"Matt Windman","o":"amNewYork","s":58,"b":"Mixed","t":2,"u":"https://www.amny.com/urbanite-1.812039/theater-review-motown-the-musical-2-stars-1.5071506","q":"Still, this elaborate, very busy production ought to please anyone looking to take a nostalgia trip and overlook its problems."},{"cn":"Holly Williams","o":"The Independent","s":52,"b":"Negative","t":2,"u":"https://www.independent.co.uk/arts-entertainment/theatre-dance/reviews/motown-the-musical-shaftesbury-theatre-review-lacking-smarts-as-well-as-soul-a6920981.html","q":"But Motown, the musical shines far less brightly, lacking smarts as well as soul."},{"cn":"Matthew Murray","o":"Talkin' Broadway","s":50,"b":"Negative","t":2,"u":"https://www.talkinbroadway.com/page/world/Motown2016.html","q":"\"It plays as an entirely different, and noticeably less compelling, show than the original version that ran on Broadway...This is not to say I was an enormous fan of that incarnation—I wasn't—but it had a size, energy, and (relative) intensity that this one lacks...It's imparted a jagged choppiness that keeps the evening from cohering..."},{"cn":"Matt Richards","o":"Real Mrhousewife","s":93,"b":"Rave","t":3,"u":"https://www.realmrhousewife.com/2016/07/28/motown-broadway-revival-review/","q":"Among the best things I've ever seen on a stage."},{"cn":"Linda Hodges","o":"BroadwayWorld","s":84,"b":"Rave","t":3,"u":"http://www.broadwayworld.com/san-francisco/article/BWW-Review-MOTOWN-THE-MUSICAL-is-Solid-Gold-20160622","d":"2016-06-22","q":"'Motown the Musical' is a solid gold hit"},{"cn":"Donna Herman","o":"Front Row Center","s":82,"b":"Positive","t":3,"u":"https://thefrontrowcenter.com/2016/07/motown-the-musical/","d":"2016-07-22","q":"You'd have to be a curmudgeon of the highest order not to enjoy this show."},{"cn":"Karen D'Souza","o":"San Jose Mercury News","s":75,"b":"Positive","t":3,"u":"http://www.mercurynews.com/entertainment/ci_30045472/review-energetic-motown-musical-motors-into-san-jose","q":"The irresistible Motown catalog is the real star here."},{"cn":"Michael Dale","o":"BroadwayWorld","s":70,"b":"Positive","t":3,"u":"https://www.broadwayworld.com/article/BWW-Review-The-Music-of-MOTOWN-Returns-Unfortunately-So-Does-The-Book-20160722","d":"2016-07-22","q":"But if the book disappoints, the dynamic company is well worth catching."}],"au":{"score":84,"designation":"Liking","sources":{"ss":{"s":88,"c":521},"mz":{"s":68,"c":66,"sr":3.4}}},"ta":"208 W 41st St, New York, NY 10036","ca":[{"n":"Chester Gregory","r":"Berry Gordy"},{"n":"Jarran Muse","r":"Marvin Gaye"},{"n":"Jesse Nager","r":"Smokey Robinson"},{"n":"Allison Semmes","r":"Diana Ross"},{"n":"Nik Alexander","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"J.J. Batteast","r":"Young Berry Gordy"},{"n":"Erick Buckley","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Chante Carmel","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Chadaé","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Lynorris Evans","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Robert Hartwell","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Trisha Jeffrey","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Elijah Ahmad Lewis","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Loren Lott","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Jarvis B. Manning, Jr.","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Krisha Marcano","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Marq Moss","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Rashad Naylor","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Leon Outlaw, Jr.","r":"Young Berry Gordy"},{"n":"Ramone Owens","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Olivia Puckett","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Jamison Scott","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Joey Stone","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Doug Storm","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Martina Sykes","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Julius Thomas III","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Nik Walker","r":"Ensemble"}]}